<div id="textDiv "> </div>
<!-- 콘텐츠 -->
					<div class="contents"><style> .subCont_small_btn > a { color: white !important; } 
</style>
<div class="contents">
<div class="mb-3" style="display: inline;"><a href="/usingDownload.do?no=631" target="_blank" title="일반전형 모집요강 다운로드" class="subCont_small_download">일반전형 모집요강 다운로드(PDF)<br /></a></div>
<div class="mb-3" style="display: inline;">
<p><br /></p>
<p><a style="margin-right: 10px;" href="/usingDownload.do?no=633" target="_blank" title="일반전형 외국인 지원자 관련 안내(PDF)" class="subCont_small_download">일반전형 외국인 지원자 관련 안내(PDF)</a><a href="/usingDownload.do?no=634" target="_blank" title="일반전형 외국인 지원자 관련 안내(영문)" class="subCont_small_download">Information on general admission foreign applicants</a></p></div>
<p><br /></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※&nbsp;'일반전형 외국인 입학'과 '외국인특별전형'은 다른 종류의 입학입니다.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;'General admission for foreigners' and 'Special admission for foreigners' are different types of admission.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※&nbsp;'일반전형 외국인 입학'과 '외국인특별전형'은 입학 진행이 따로 주체되기 때문에, 별도로 원서접수를 해야합니다.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;The admission for 'General admission for foreigners' and 'Special admission for foreigners' are subject to&nbsp;separate type, so you have to apply separately too.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※&nbsp;'일반전형 외국인 입학'은 '외국인특별전형'과 수혜가능한 장학 종류가 완전히 다릅니다.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;'General admission for foreigners' is completely different from 'Special admission for foreigners' in the type of scholarship that can be benefited from.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※&nbsp;'일반전형 외국인 입학'은 면접고사 시, 한국인 지원자들과 함께 진행 및 경쟁됩니다.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;'General admission for foreigners' is conducted and competed with Korean applicants during the interview.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">※&nbsp;외국인특별전형으로 입학을 원할 경우, [입학] > [International Students] > [Admission Guide(English)]를 참고하시길 바랍니다.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;If you want to enter through a special admission for foreigners, please refer to [입학] > International Students > [Admission Guide (English).</span></p>
<p><br />
<br /></p>
<p class="bull_tit">2026학년도 전기&nbsp;입학전형 일정</p>
